  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nCheck which option gives sum = 90\n\n**Formula used:**\n\nConvert mixed fractions into improper form and add\n\n**Calculations:**\n\n**Option 1:**\n\n42 (4)/(5)+6 (1)/(6) \n\n⇒ 42 + 4/5 + 6 + 1/6\n\n⇒ 48 + (24/30 + 5/30)\n\n⇒ 48 + 29/30 ≠ 90\n\n**Option 2:**\n\n43 (1)/(2)+7 (1)/(4)\n\n⇒ 43 + 1/2 + 7 + 1/4\n\n⇒ 50 + 3/4 = 50.75 ≠ 90\n\n**Option 3:**\n\n45 (1)/(2)+(89)/(2)\n\n⇒ 45.5 + 44.5\n\n⇒ = 90 ✔\n\n**Option 4:**\n\n52 (1)/(7)+63\n\n⇒ 115 1/7 ≠ 90\n\n**∴ Correct answer = 45 (1)/(2)+(89)/(2)**",
